    "updated_at": "2015-10-27T16:59:45Z",
    "body": "cc @mnot - I'm a bit confused on the context - is this saying that 2 different uris with 206 responses should be stitched together just because they both had the same original uri before redirection? (and if they pass cors). That seems odd - they're different resources.\n",
