    "updated_at": "2015-11-03T14:07:51Z",
    "body": "Okay, so it sounds like the HTML standard would need to do this for media elements. @foolip, have you looked into doing this? It would perhaps also require some overrides then to make sure Fetch does not do anything bad upstream.\n",
